  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/533835/diamond-spheres-hustle-bustle?src=newest%3Faffiliate_id%3D3028400\">Diamond Spheres: Hustle &amp; Bustle</a></sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Performance sphere ((instrumental or lyric) package), associated ranks 10.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Choose a single (instrumental) or (lyric) talent that you possess and have the appropriate package for—you gain the benefits of the chosen instrumental or lyric as a constant effect.</p>\n<p>Due to not being an actual use of this ability, it does not need to be maintained (nor does it receive benefits for being maintained), and only affects you. Such a lyric does not count towards the number of lyrics you can be affected by at one time and can still be expended, returning after 1 minute has elapsed.</p>\n<p>You can spend 1 hour to change the chosen (instrumental) or (lyric) talent to a different talent that you possess. You cannot have both a constant instrumental and lyric active at the same time.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/operative-feats#toc43\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
